<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1020', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', padding: '52px 60px 30px 60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4D8DFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2.2 }}>01 · 动机</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8 }}>
        高分子多出一层描述，晶体没有
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#24334C', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44, marginTop: 26 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 470, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#93A8C2', letterSpacing: 1.4, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>无机晶体</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
                {['组成', '晶胞', '性质'].map((label, i) => (
                    <Box key={label} style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        {i > 0 ? <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#5A7192', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 4, marginBottom: 4, width: 30, textAlign: 'center' }}>↓</Text> : null}
                        <Box style={{ width: 320, padding: '12px 18px', background: '#111B2E', border: '1px solid #24334C', borderRadius: 6 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C3D0E2' }}>{label}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                两层就够了：组成加晶胞几何就把结构定死。<span style={{ color: '#FFB020' }}>菜谱就是菜本身。</span>
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1, background: '#24334C' }} />

        <Box style={{ width: 600, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFB020', letterSpacing: 1.4, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>高分子</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 340, padding: '12px 18px', background: '#111B2E', border: '1px solid #24334C', borderRadius: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C3D0E2' }}>组成</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#5A7192', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 4, marginBottom: 4, width: 30, textAlign: 'center' }}>↓</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 340, padding: '12px 18px', background: '#111B2E', border: '1px solid #24334C', borderRadius: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C3D0E2' }}>重复单元 —— 一条 PSMILES 串</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#5A7192', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 4, marginBottom: 4, width: 30, textAlign: 'center' }}>↓</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 520, padding: '12px 18px', background: '#16233A', border: '1px solid #FFB020', borderRadius: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#FFB020', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>链 —— 在压缩时被丢掉了</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C3D0E2', marginTop: 5, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                        分子量分布 · 序列 · 立构规整性 · 形貌 · 加工历史
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#5A7192', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 4, marginBottom: 4, width: 30, textAlign: 'center' }}>↓</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 340, padding: '12px 18px', background: '#111B2E', border: '1px solid #24334C', borderRadius: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C3D0E2' }}>实测性质</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '14px 20px', background: '#111B2E', borderLeft: '2px solid #4D8DFF' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            基准自己写下的局限：当前版本没有显式编码分子量分布、立构规整性、形貌、加工历史、器件结构或测量协议。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#93A8C2', marginTop: 4 }}>
            转述自 PolyBench，Polym. Sci. Technol. 2026 —— 这个缺口上游自己承认，不是我们编的。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>第 32 组 · 链值多少？</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>2 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
